      "content": "Documenting every incident can help establish a pattern of behavior and provides a clear record of your concerns. Start by keeping a log of all dates, times, and details of the incidents, including any communications or conversations related to each event. Include your reactions and any witness statements, if applicable. Consider keeping a separate log for payroll and HR-related issues specifically. It's also a good idea to keep any relevant emails or other written communications on file.",
